<PARA INFOID = "T010039A133" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "20Sep2003"     INFOTYPE = "PARTS" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Piston</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>Piston weight has been reduced by shortening the compression height and using a short skirt. Also, the top has a slant squish structure to optimize fuel economy and volumetric efficiency.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The piston skirt width has been reduced, and a striated finish and resin coating have been applied to reduce friction.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Lightweight piston pins with a short overall length have been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Compression ring No.1,No.2 has a narrow width to lower tension and reduce friction. Also, compression ring No.1 has been PVD treated to ensure wear resistance.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The oil ring has a lightweight 2-piece construction, reducing friction while ensuring good oil control.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
